#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:5
#: f85457b0e2bc49b6add69a2880c8239c
msgid "LightWare SF20 / LW20"
msgstr "LightWare SF20 / LW20"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:7
#: 116404ee067d403cb5200a9913dad6f0
msgid ""
"The `Lightware SF20 <https://lightwarelidar.com/shop/sf20-c-100-m/>`__ and "
"`LW20 <https://lightwarelidar.com/shop/lw20-c-100-m/>`__ are small but long "
"range (100m) and accurate range finders. There are two models, the LW20/Ser "
"which uses a serial interface and LW20/I2C which uses an I2C interface."
msgstr ""
"`Lightware SF20 <https://lightwarelidar.com/shop/sf20-c-100-m/>`__ 和 `LW20 "
"<https://lightwarelidar.com/shop/lw20-c-100-m/>`__ "
"是小巧但远程（100m）且精确的测距仪。有两种型号，LW20/Ser 使用串口接口，LW20/I2C 使用 I2C 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:13
#: 056b96a62ba44433b6fbde64280e7d10
msgid "Serial connection"
msgstr "串口连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:15
#: 7f7cf146c399496d8fce0862e87de37b
msgid ""
"For a serial connection you can use any spare UART. Connect the RX line of "
"the UART to the TX line of the Lidar, and the TX line of the UART to the RX "
"line of the Lidar. Also connect the GND and 5V lines. You do not need flow "
"control pins."
msgstr ""
"对于串口连接，可使用任何空闲的 UART。将 UART 的 RX 线连接到激光雷达的 TX 线，将 UART 的 TX 线连接到激光雷达的 RX "
"线，同时连接 GND 和 5V 线。不需要流控引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:20
#: c9e00c1fd7bc4c2da646aa549d1bbeec
msgid "The diagram below shows how to connect to SERIAL4."
msgstr "下图显示了如何连接到 SERIAL4。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:24
#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:52
#: 1878a81a9b774d11a05044c791e7cf21 36cf84743c1d46ee80d06d88d3676881
msgid "If using the caseless SF20 ensure the cable looks like below:"
msgstr "如果使用无外壳的 SF20，请确保线缆如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:28
#: 11eb209413044a27b8f05d35eac7de2c
msgid ""
"You then need to setup the serial port and rangefinder parameters. If you "
"have used the SERIAL4/5 port on the Pixhawk then you would set the following"
" parameters if its the first rangefinder in the system (this can be done "
"using the *Mission Planner* **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter List** page):"
msgstr ""
"然后需要设置串口和测距仪参数。如果使用 Pixhawk 上的 SERIAL4/5 端口，则如果是系统中的第一个测距仪应设置以下参数（可在 "
"*Mission Planner* **配置/调参 \\| 完整参数列表** 页面中完成）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:33
#: e75954b7e1e5449f91059a3677d9feeb
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:34
#: adea5db3467a4fc3845d39e1f9dab42c
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud) for newer sensors, 19"
" (19200 baud) for sensors manufactured before mid 2018"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115（115200 波特率），适用于较新的传感器；19（19200 "
"波特率），适用于 2018 年中期以前生产的传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:35
#: a7893756b3df4e1285309ffeefd0ccdf
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 8 (LightWareSerial)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 8（LightWareSerial）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:36
#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:61
#: 37be3615e5624e3e9b65545f81a7f2eb 3b3a7705a0b84a97b16061b9c729ab26
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:37
#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:62
#: 126cb13341484761b63385d676ce061b e6665b27a6ac48788538d8f9e9dc7f8e
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:38
#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:63
#: 72bc01c3101947f3ba195e739d344ac1 a6a0bbd9954147fc8d09d0fea5369da0
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **95**.  *This is the distance in meters "
"that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **95**。*这是测距仪可以可靠读取的距离（米）。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:39
#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:64
#: 49341206695249508cdf6377b2e7c22b c68d78680f1e4ab5ba034e5c2abff45b
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in metres from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 "
"*或更精确地，飞行器降落时测距仪到地面的距离（米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装方式。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:41
#: 0452177457844926a73942c3bd133018
msgid ""
"If you instead were using the Telem2 port on the Pixhawk then you would set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9, and :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD "
"<SERIAL2_BAUD>` to 115 (115200 baud) or 19 (19200 baud)"
msgstr ""
"如果改用 Pixhawk 的 Telem2 端口，则应设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = "
"9，以及 :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` 为 115（115200 波特率）或 19（19200 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:43
#: 59ef8e4fa46440c8972bab6ec0d6d41e
msgid ""
"Note that you may need to use a separate 5V power supply for the Lidar on "
"some flight boards. Refer to the power consumption in the manual for the "
"Lidar and the limits for peripheral power on your autopilot."
msgstr "注意，某些飞控板上可能需要为激光雷达使用单独的 5V 电源。请参阅激光雷达手册中的功耗数据以及飞控外设供电限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:46
#: 72107f9b61474847a8dc1764b9202e9e
msgid "I2C connection"
msgstr "I2C 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:48
#: 306205f7cd2a4399ac74aa53876d328e
msgid ""
"Connect the SDA line of the Lidar to the SDA line of the I2C port on the "
"Pixhawk, and the SCL line of the Lidar to the SCL line of the I2C port. Also"
" connect the GND and 5V lines."
msgstr ""
"将激光雷达的 SDA 线连接到 Pixhawk I2C 端口的 SDA 线，将激光雷达的 SCL 线连接到 I2C 端口的 SCL 线，同时连接 GND"
" 和 5V 线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:56
#: d1ffd0b47650442fa34414918016c043
msgid ""
"You then need to configure the rangefinder parameters as shown below (this "
"cn be done suing the *Mission Planner* **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter "
"List** page):"
msgstr "然后需要按如下所示配置测距仪参数（可在 *Mission Planner* **配置/调参 \\| 完整参数列表** 页面中完成）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:59
#: 2b8e57e5cfa34f8dbb2e8095b7683411
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 7 (LightWareI2C)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 7（LightWareI2C）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:60
#: ee9ef84f1cc04f24bbc1675d61b293ad
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ADDR <RNGFND1_ADDR>` = 102 (I2C Address of lidar in decimal)."
"  *Note that this setting is in decimal. The default address is 0x66 "
"hexadecimal which is 102 in decimal.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ADDR <RNGFND1_ADDR>` = 102（十进制的激光雷达 I2C "
"地址）。*注意该设置为十进制。默认地址为十六进制 0x66，即十进制 102。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:67
#: 329fccc3794144d187b7eb0e61ca9f27
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-lw20-lidar.rst:69
#: e85084d429594ea8988d63e7f5326ba8
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"
